if mibBuilder.loadTexts: tBgpPeerNgMd5AuthKey.setDescription('The value of tBgpPeerNgMd5AuthKey specifies the authentication key to\n         be used between BGP peers neighbors before establishing sessions.\n\n         Authentication is done using the MD5 message based digest protocol.\n\n         Authentication can be configured globally and applied to all BGP peers\n         or per group or per peer. The most specific value is used.\n\n         The authentication key can be any combination of letters or numbers.\n         Note that the string CANNOT contain embedded nulls.')
